WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.186 --> 00:00:18.450
wanted to stay longer at the Crystal Palace, but Florence wanted to leave.

2
00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:23.795
"I didn't get to see everything," Vinnie complained.

3
00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:32.310
"Hush, Florence needs our help," Mandy whispered as the children followed Florence outside.

4
00:00:33.491 --> 00:00:36.813
Suddenly, Florence cried out, "Miss Charlotte!"

5
00:00:37.974 --> 00:00:42.017
A girl about Mandy's age was walking on the other side of the street.

6
00:00:43.317 --> 00:00:45.119
She stopped when she saw Florence.

7
00:00:45.139 --> 00:00:47.200
"Miss Charlotte!"

8
00:00:47.741 --> 00:00:48.901
cried Florence again.

9
00:00:50.442 --> 00:00:53.224
Charlotte crossed the street looking very sorry.

10
00:00:53.244 --> 00:00:58.088
"This is most upsetting," Florence said to her.

11
00:00:59.404 --> 00:01:01.665
"Don't be angry," Charlotte said.

12
00:01:01.685 --> 00:01:05.487
"I just wanted to have some fun by myself."

13
00:01:05.507 --> 00:01:09.590
"Well, it wasn't fun for me!"

14
00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:10.890
Florence said.

15
00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:12.671
"Who are you?"

16
00:01:13.932 --> 00:01:16.693
asked Charlotte, looking at Vinnie and Mandy.

17
00:01:17.914 --> 00:01:20.195
Florence introduced the children to her.

18
00:01:20.215 --> 00:01:22.697
"You're visiting London?"

19
00:01:23.297 --> 00:01:24.738
Charlotte said excitedly.

20
00:01:24.758 --> 00:01:28.300
"Florence, we must show them around.

21
00:01:29.428 --> 00:01:31.270
We can go to father's factory!"

22
00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:33.612
"A factory?"

23
00:01:34.192 --> 00:01:34.893
asked Mandy.

24
00:01:36.274 --> 00:01:40.417
After the Crystal Palace, a factory didn't sound very interesting.

25
00:01:40.437 --> 00:01:44.881
"Your father wouldn't like it," began Florence.

26
00:01:46.543 --> 00:01:47.563
"Would you like to go?"

27
00:01:48.644 --> 00:01:49.986
Charlotte asked the children.

28
00:01:50.006 --> 00:01:53.188
"Well," replied Vinnie.

29
00:01:54.289 --> 00:01:55.750
"We can take that cab!"

30
00:01:56.311 --> 00:01:57.352
Charlotte exclaimed.

31
00:01:58.396 --> 00:02:02.577
She ran to a nearby carriage and got in before Florence could object.

32
00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:05.678
"This is a cab?"

33
00:02:06.158 --> 00:02:10.340
whispered Vinnie, climbing into the horse-drawn carriage.

34
00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:17.101
"Cool!" The carriage rolled through the London streets.

35
00:02:18.362 --> 00:02:22.303
The children listened to the pleasant clip-clop of the horse's hooves.

36
00:02:24.023 --> 00:02:28.914
As they rode through the city, Mandy noticed the streets changing.

37
00:02:30.975 --> 00:02:37.019
The colorful streets, alive with people and shops, became dark and empty.

38
00:02:37.039 --> 00:02:40.381
"Where is everyone?"

39
00:02:40.942 --> 00:02:41.662
asked Mandy.

40
00:02:43.023 --> 00:02:44.824
She looked out the carriage window.

41
00:02:46.005 --> 00:02:48.707
Poorly dressed children were playing outside.

42
00:02:49.948 --> 00:02:52.430
A few older people sat on doorsteps.

43
00:02:53.851 --> 00:02:57.388
"Most people are in the factories," explained Florence.

44
00:02:58.569 --> 00:03:01.249
Then she pointed to some big, brick buildings.

45
00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:05.691
Their tall chimneys poured dark smoke into the sky.

46
00:03:05.711 --> 00:03:09.472
"Are all these buildings factories?"

47
00:03:10.772 --> 00:03:13.793
asked Mandy, looking at the gloomy buildings.

48
00:03:13.813 --> 00:03:16.874
"Yes," said Florence.

49
00:03:18.614 --> 00:03:19.554
"Here we are!"

50
00:03:20.095 --> 00:03:21.715
Charlotte called out cheerfully.

51
00:03:22.935 --> 00:03:24.596
They stopped at a factory door.

52
00:03:25.944 --> 00:03:28.925
Charlotte jumped out of the carriage and ran inside.

53
00:03:30.026 --> 00:03:32.607
Florence asked the cab driver to wait for them.

54
00:03:33.767 --> 00:03:37.709
Then Vinnie, Mandy, and Florence followed Charlotte inside.

55
00:03:39.069 --> 00:03:42.391
They walked into a large room filled with long tables.

56
00:03:43.711 --> 00:03:48.793
Ten women sat at each table, among piles of pieces of cloth.

57
00:03:50.134 --> 00:03:52.535
The women were sewing the pieces by hand.

58
00:03:53.935 --> 00:03:55.116
Mandy looked around.

59
00:03:56.902 --> 00:03:57.904
"Vinnie, look!"

60
00:03:58.425 --> 00:04:00.030
she said in a shocked voice.

61
00:04:01.674 --> 00:04:05.203
Many of the people working in the factory were children.
